{"id":"estrella","lemma":"estrella","pos":"noun","rank":797,"glosses":["star (celestial body)","star (shape)","star (most important person in e.g. a film)"],"ipa":"/esˈtɾeʝa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"estrellas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-estrella.wav","formAudio":{"estrellas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-estrellas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Descubrió una nueva estrella.","en":"He discovered a new star.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/943381"},{"text":"Las estrellas fugaces son meteoritos.","en":"Shooting stars are meteorites.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/770013"},{"text":"Mira aquella estrella fugaz.","en":"Look at that shooting star.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527541"},{"text":"¿Había estrellas en el cielo?","en":"Were there any stars in the sky?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/554850"},{"text":"¡Mira! Una estrella fugaz.","en":"Look! There goes a shooting star.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684342"}]}